      "created_at": "2016-09-28T17:54:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was playing against the Matriarch in the Enclave of the Endlings. On the Environment turn, Slamara came into play.</p>\n<p>At the end of the Environment turn, Slamara revealed a Fowl card and put it into play. Then Slamara proceeded to reveal hero cards. Then it transitioned to the start of the Villain turn.</p>\n<p>Should the Matriarch have played the top card of her deck after that Fowl card entered play?</p>",
