      "created_at": "2016-09-29T15:14:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe that when you play a card, you put the card into play. &nbsp;But when you put a card into play, you haven't played a card.</p><p>It is an important distinction for cards like Informant, who do not react to cards entering play, just cards being played.</p>",
