      "created_at": "2016-10-14T18:09:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Or rather, playing a card results in it being put into play. &nbsp;For instance, if an effect triggers on the villain playing a card, and Parse uses Buffer Overflow, the discarded card was still played and would trigger that effect (probably resulting in it triggering twice, since the vilain will then play a second card).</p>",
